### @antoinezambelli · 2026-06-06T22:35:52Z

This appears to be the same root cause as #26363 : the multi_agent_v2 filter was accidentally affecting v1. Keeping this open until a release includes the fix, since the current latest release 0.137.0 still exposes only fork_context/items/message on Windows/Ubuntu and blocks custom agent role selection.

---

### @phuturesh · 2026-06-08T19:19:05Z

See #26363, #26114, and #26599: assigning`features.multi_agent_v2.hide_spawn_agent_metadata` to `false` will set it up.

---

### @antoinezambelli · 2026-06-09T02:00:22Z

Updating to v0.138.0 fixed it.

